  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logos/1636924320_6570072_da7ddec582e976858ccce66a8994d70e.png",
  "description": "<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-40ed2850-7fff-18de-5827-09446206626d\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(37, 42, 43); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">FORT WORTH (November 2021) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(37, 42, 43); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">– Fort Worth-native Courtney Copeland Acuna has launched </span><a href=\"https://thisbelongsto.shop/\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This Belongs To ____</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(37, 42, 43); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">, an online social enterprise that sells gorgeous high-end travel pieces, and donates a large duffle bag to a child in foster care for every bag sold. Acuna, a young mother with a background in merchandising and fulfillment, hatched This Belongs To ____ last spring through a successful Kickstarter campaign after hearing about the number of foster children who have to move their belongings in trash bags, and the frequency with which they move.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"> </p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(37, 42, 43); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">At any given time, there are over 400,000 kids in the foster care system within the U.S. alone. And, it’s normal for a child to have moved from home to home more than 15 times, which means moving almost every year of their childhood. Acuna’s initial Kickstarter aimed to raise $32,000 in 32 days, and instead raised $42,000. </span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(37, 42, 43); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">“Earlier this year I read a shocking Instagram post about how most of these children make those intimidating moves with nothing but a trash bag to hold their belongings,” said Acuna. “I know sending a massive duffle bag won’t solve all of the challenges these children and the foster care system face, but I felt we could at least try to help them build a sense of confidence, belonging, and ownership. There are many stories online from people who grew up in the foster system and felt more confidence and dignity entering a new home when they could do so with a bag of their own.”</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(37, 42, 43); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This Belongs To ______ merchandise ranges from hoodies and hats to its flagship leather or canvas Weekender, the perfect gift for the traveler in your life. The stylish tote can hold more than 10 outfits, two to three pairs of shoes, a laptop, and slips easily over a suitcase thanks to a convenient double zipper. When a bag is sold, This Belongs To ______ sends a large canvas duffle bag to Foster Angels featuring a blank space for the recipient’s name that it will permanently belong to.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(37, 42, 43); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">“Our vision is simple – you need a great and gorgeous bag that will see you through work trips, holiday getaways, international escapes, or weekend retreats – and these kids need a bag of their own to carry their treasures,” added Acuna. “We’re all on a journey, so here’s to helping theirs.”</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(37, 42, 43); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Artisan-made in the Los Angeles area, This Belongs To ______ bags use domestically sourced hardware and are made one-at-a-time out of premium leather or rugged canvas trimmed with leather. Featuring dual-zipper closures with matte black hardware, the Weekender is roomy with multiple interior compartments, a separate lower compartment, a generous 12-inch drop handle, and an adjustable/removable shoulder strap that can be worn as a crossbody. After its soft launch and pre-orders, the company has already delivered hundreds of bags to Foster Angels, and expects an even busier first holiday season.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(37, 42, 43); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This Belongs To ______ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">shop is available online at </span><a href=\"https://thisbelongsto.shop\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; text-decoration-line: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">https://thisbelongsto.shop</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">, and the original Kickstarter page with Acuna's story can be viewed </span><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/thisbelongsto/this-belongs-to-a-weekender-bag-that-gives-back-1-for-1\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; text-decoration-line: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">.</span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Avenir, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></span></div></span>",
